      {
        "text": "Patrick Hanley is a small business owner and president of the New Trier Democrats. He chairs the Winnetka Environmental and Forestry Commission. He co-founded Operation Swing State. His campaign says the group mobilized over 10,000 volunteers in 2024 to canvass in Michigan and Wisconsin. His campaign says he previously worked in the U.S. Senate and the Justice Department.",
